SaviaTech repository licensing
=============================

This repository is a monorepo and does not grant a single licence for the whole
tree. Each component has its own licence, and the full licence texts are kept
next to the code they cover:

  packages/rules/   MIT
  apps/web/         GPL-3.0-or-later
  content/          CC-BY-4.0
  docs/             CC-BY-4.0
  scripts/ and root tooling files   MIT

The authoritative licence for a file is the SPDX identifier in its header or the
LICENSE file in its component directory. If those are missing or contradictory,
open an issue before reusing the code.

Clinical content, consent text and referral data are placeholders marked SAMPLE
and require Social Work review before any real-world use. See AGENTS.md.
